<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 111 0 R
/T (       1.  First-Touch Identification: The system scans all historical orders to find the absolute             first purchase date for every unique Customer ID.        2. Cohort Assignment: Customers are grouped into "Monthly Buckets" based on that first              purchase date \(e.g., all Feb 2024 starters stay in the "Feb 2024" group forever\).        3.  Behavioral Tracking: The pipeline then cross-references these groups against all              subsequent orders to calculate retention and repeat purchase depth.)
/E (       1.  First-Touch Identification: The system scans all historical orders to find the absolute             first purchase date for every unique Customer ID.        2. Cohort Assignment: Customers are grouped into "Monthly Buckets" based on that first              purchase date \(e.g., all Feb 2024 starters stay in the "Feb 2024" group forever\).        3.  Behavioral Tracking: The pipeline then cross-references these groups against all              subsequent orders to calculate retention and repeat purchase depth.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
